# 🛒 Supermarket Sales — Data Analysis Project

> **Comprehensive Statistical & Visual Analysis of 1,000 Supermarket Transactions**

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project performs an end-to-end data analysis on a real-world supermarket sales dataset covering **1,000 transactions** across **3 cities** and **6 product lines** in Q1 2019. The analysis answers 10 business questions using statistical methods, correlation analysis, and data visualization — culminating in a unified Power BI dashboard.

| Attribute | Details |
|---|---|
| **Source File** | `supermarket_sales_project_2.csv` |
| **Total Records** | 1,000 sales transactions |
| **Branches & Cities** | 3 branches — Yangon, Naypyitaw, Mandalay |
| **Product Lines** | 6 categories of retail products |
| **Date Range** | January 2019 – March 2019 |
| **Key Variables** | Unit Price, Quantity, Gross Income, Rating, Payment Method |

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- **MS Excel** — Data cleaning, EDA, pivot tables, statistical analysis, correlation
- **Power BI** — Interactive dashboards and data visualizations
- **MS Word** — Structured project report with findings and interpretation

